            <div class="space-y-12">
                <!-- 2020 -->
                <div class="timeline-item pl-12">
                    <div class="timeline-marker">
                        <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2020: Our Beginning</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            Munric Arts began as a small workshop in Nairobi, founded with a vision to create quality handcrafted furniture. Starting with just a few skilled craftsmen, we focused on custom chairs and tables using sustainable wood.
                        </p>
                        <img src="/api/placeholder/500/300" alt="Our first shop" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg mb-2">
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 2021 -->
                <div class="timeline-item pl-12">
                    <div class="timeline-marker">
                        <i class="fas fa-expand-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2021: Growing Our Community</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            We expanded our artisan network to include 15 local craftspeople and moved to our first permanent workshop location in Kilifi Town. This year marked the introduction of our Kikoy clothing and traditional hat collections.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 2022 -->
                <div class="timeline-item pl-12">
                    <div class="timeline-marker">
                        <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2022: Going Digital</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            We launched our online presence, making our coastal treasures available to customers beyond Kenya. This year also saw us hosting our first artisan workshop series, teaching traditional craft techniques to the next generation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 2023 -->
                <div class="timeline-item pl-12">
                    <div class="timeline-marker">
                        <i class="fas fa-award"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2023: Recognition & Expansion</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            Munric Arts received recognition for excellence in furniture craftsmanship. Our team of artisans grew to 25 members, and we opened our expanded showroom to showcase our full furniture collection and custom design services.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 2024 -->
                <div class="timeline-item pl-12">
                    <div class="timeline-marker">
                        <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2024: Community Initiatives</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            We launched our artisan support program, providing business training and microloans to help our craftspeople grow their own enterprises. We also began partnerships with local schools to offer craft education programs.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 2025 -->
                <div class="timeline-item pl-12">
                    <div class="timeline-marker">
                        <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2025: Today & Beyond</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            Today, Munric Arts proudly supports over 30 skilled artisans and their families. We've expanded our workshop and showroom space, and continue to develop new collections that blend traditional woodworking techniques with contemporary designs. 
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700">
                            As we look to the future, we're excited to further expand our reach while deepening our commitment to sustainable practices and timeless furniture creation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
